@startuml
title Login Flow Overview (US-09)
skinparam style strictuml
autonumber

actor User
participant Frontend
participant Backend
participant "Cache / RateLimit" as Guard
participant "TU REST API" as TU
database DB

User -> Frontend : Submit credentials
Frontend -> Backend : POST /api/auth/login
Backend -> Backend : Validate format (400 if invalid)
Backend -> Guard : Check 5m cache & IP limit (429 if exceeded)
Backend -> TU : POST /auth/Ad/verify
TU --> Backend : Status & TU profile
Backend -> DB : Upsert User (role, profile, no passwordHash)
Backend --> Frontend : 200 OK {accessToken, user} / 401 / 403
Frontend --> User : Navigate home or show alert
@enduml
